{"unit_id":"yuhangkang__dsh-ide-sidebar#card-zh","repo":"yuhangkang/dsh-ide-sidebar","commit":"96441811cdca4802a2cc1dbb6ead7f8263acc00d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ide-sidebar（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 侧边栏提供 IDE 式工作区切换和会话浏览。它通过侧边栏插槽挂载浏览器界面，显示工作区下拉菜单、按工作区筛选的会话列表，以及完成或待处理状态灯。用户可以搜索工作区和会话、创建或重命名工作区、删除工作区并归档会话，也能打开现有会话或在所选工作区启动会话。适合同时维护多个项目、需要快速切换上下文的 DSH Web 用户。插件没有 API 密钥或外部服务配置，依赖 DSH 注入的客户端接口，并在浏览器中保存选中的工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:91-132","lib/client.js:197-212","lib/client.js:243-267"]}
{"unit_id":"yuhangkang__dsh-ide-sidebar#card-en","repo":"yuhangkang/dsh-ide-sidebar","commit":"96441811cdca4802a2cc1dbb6ead7f8263acc00d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ide-sidebar adds workspace switching and session browsing to DSH Web. It filters sessions by workspace, shows status, and supports searching, creating or renaming workspaces, archiving sessions, and opening or starting sessions. It uses DSH clients and local storage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:91-132","lib/client.js:197-212","lib/client.js:243-267"]}
